libniji C library: locale support (placeholder)
 libniji is an implementation of the GNU C Library's ABI (glibc $abi, x86-64).
 This package holds a set of character maps under /usr/share/i18n/charmaps;
 the locale compiler (localedef) is in libc-bin. Locale source data is not
 part of this build yet; the package exists so that dependencies on locales
 are met.
